{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-09-15 16:15:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK ELECTS DEIRDRE MAHLAN AND JAIME RAMIREZ TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'DALLAS, SEPT. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE:KMB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ELECTED DEIRDRE MAHLAN AND JAIME RAMIREZ TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY.'}{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-09-15 12:55:00', 'title': 'HUGGIES® AND KAM CHANCELLOR TEAM UP TO HELP NORTHWEST U.S. FAMILIES GAIN ACCESS TO CLEAN DIAPERS', 'text': 'NEENAH, WIS., SEPT. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PRO DAD AND FOOTBALL LEGEND, KAM CHANCELLOR , AND\xa0HUGGIES\xa0PLUS, A LINE OF DIAPERS EXCLUSIVELY AVAILABLE AT COSTCO, WILL DONATE $10,000 TO THE NATIONAL DIAPER BANK NETWORK TO HELP FAMILIES IN THE NORTHWEST U.S. REGION* HAVE ACCESS TO CLEAN DIAPERS.'}